% ============================================================================
% manual.bib — references with NO registered DOI
% ============================================================================
%
% This is the ONLY hand-written BibTeX in the repository, and it exists solely
% because JMLR, NeurIPS, and PMLR do not register DOIs for these items. It is
% concatenated verbatim into the generated references.bib.
%
% RULES FOR THIS FILE — it is the one place a hallucinated reference could
% enter the repo, so it is deliberately constrained:
%
%   1. An entry belongs here ONLY if the work genuinely has no DOI. If a DOI
%      exists (including one assigned later), move it to doi_list.txt.
%   2. Every entry MUST carry a `url` pointing at the PUBLISHER's own record
%      (not a preprint server, not a personal page, not Google Scholar).
%   3. Every entry MUST carry `note = {No registered DOI; verified against
%      publisher record YYYY-MM-DD}` recording when a human last opened that
%      URL and compared the fields against it.
%   4. `./generate_bibtex.sh --check` enforces rules 2 and 3 mechanically.
%
% Each entry below was verified on 2026-08-17 against the publisher metadata
% tags served at its `url` (citation_title / citation_author / citation_volume
% / citation_firstpage / citation_lastpage).
% ============================================================================

